  "request": "A grand, cinematic symphonic metal fusion in raga Charukeshi, about 42 seconds long, around 130 beats per minute. Open with a very short sitar alap over a rising orchestral swell, then slam into a big anthemic main riff with the full orchestra and keep building intensity. Give the sitar a full soaring solo over the driving band, build to a triumphant climax, and finish on a big hard stop.",
